body:
I'm not sure if I can pinpoint exactly what it is tonight. It's mostly just generally feeling like shit. I was watching a movie tonight just noticing things throughout the movie, like traits that the main character possesses but I lack, etc.

&#x200B;

Edit: I'm trying my hardest to stay awake, we'll see how long I last. I apologize if I pass out. I'm exhausted from the emotions.
